        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "„Kelon treibt unsere Motoren an und Aerolit eröffnet uns Zugang zum Himmel. Welche Höhen werden wir mit den anderen beiden Primordiae erreichen?“ – Basem",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "\"Il kelon alimenta i nostri motori, l'aerolite ci dà accesso ai cieli. Quali vette raggiungeremo con le altre due primordiae?\" - Basem",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "«El kelón alimenta nuestros motores y el aerolito nos da acceso al cielo. ¿Qué nuevas cotas alcanzaremos con los otros dos primordiales?». — Basem",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "« Le Kélon alimente les moteurs, l'Aérolithe donne accès au ciel. Quels sommets atteindrons-nous avec les deux autres Primordiae ? » - Basem",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "\"Kelon powers our engines, Aerolith gives us access to the skies. What heights will we reach with the other two Primordiae?\" - Basem",
          "locale": "en_US"
        }
      },
      "id": "01JNRGBWKSVK8T2S450KGRY0YW",
      "text": "\"Kelon powers our engines, Aerolith gives us access to the skies. What heights will we reach with the other two Primordiae?\" - Basem"
    }
  ],
